Economy Chest
=============

Money x{{MONEY}} and XP x{{XP}} for American Truck Simulator.

Every job pays {{MONEY_PCT}} of stock and awards {{XP_PCT}} of stock experience --
freight market, cargo market, quick jobs and your AI drivers alike. Cargo prices,
fines, loans, garage and truck prices are untouched, so the only thing that changes
is how fast money and levels come in.

Built from: {{SOURCE_NOTE}}

Notes
-----
* Single player only. Do not use in Convoy with players who do not have it.
* Load order matters: only one money/XP economy mod can be active at a time.
  Put this one at the top of the Mod Manager list.
* Jobs are priced when they are generated. Offers already sitting in the freight
  market when you enable the mod keep their old payout -- sleep or skip a few hours
  and the new offers will use the new rates.
* Removing the mod returns rates to stock. It does not claw back money you earned.
